    {
      "id": "torch_loader_flags",
      "finding": "The authenticated torch helper sets USE_GLOBAL_DEPS=True and USE_RTLD_GLOBAL_WITH_LIBTORCH=False. The inherited torch __init__ analysis still allows a truthy TORCH_USE_RTLD_GLOBAL environment override; default source settings do not prove original dlopen scope or provider selection.",
