    {
      "id": "spinloop_import_and_fallback",
      "finding": "shm_broadcast imports torch before conditionally importing vllm.spinloop. VLLM_USE_SPINLOOP_EXT defaults to bool(int(\"0\")); successful import enables the extension, ImportError leaves it disabled. The original saved metadata does not record this flag. Calls additionally require the enabled flag and a queue condition; importing and invoking are distinct events.",
