    {
      "id": "libgomp_preload_condition",
      "finding": "The inherited cpu.py analysis shows optional OpenMP preload insertion only when existing LD_PRELOAD lacks libomp/libgomp/libiomp. The embedded original LD_PRELOAD contains libiomp5.so, so if unchanged at that call the optional auto-libgomp preload path is skipped. This does not select or discharge either DT_NEEDED libgomp.so.1 edge. An environment update cannot retroactively preload an already-running process.",
